n^{2}{\\alpha}\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}-3\\cos^{5}{\\alpha}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the expression:\n\n$$\n-2\\sin^{5}{\\alpha}-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}\\cos^{2}{\\alpha}-3\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}-3\\cos^{5}{\\alpha}=-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot(\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}+\\cos^{2}{\\alpha})-3\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot(\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}+\\cos^{2}{\\alpha})\n$$\n\nThen, we use $\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}+\\cos^{2}{\\alpha}=1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot(\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}+\\cos^{2}{\\alpha})-3\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot(\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}+\\cos^{2}{\\alpha}) & =-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot 1-3\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}-3\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-2\\sin^{5}{\\alpha}-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}\\cos^{2}{\\alpha}-3\\sin^{2}{\\alpha}\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}-3\\cos^{5}{\\alpha}=-2\\sin^{3}{\\alpha}-3\\cos^{3}{\\alpha}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["4dbc1be4-16b4-5e63-b06b-5cdf8c3a1d61"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "7e6fa6d8-14f9-5d7e-bc0a-c0ac762d492d" :answer/id #uuid "7e6fa6d8-14f9-5d7e-bc0a-c0ac762d492d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\sin^{5}{t}+3\\sin^{3}{t}\\cos^{2}{t}+4\\cos{t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9b2645af-aa72-5f2a-96a8-a02b386cf848" :answer/id #uuid "9b2645af-aa72-5f2a-96a8-a02b386cf848" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\sin^{3}{t}-4\\cos{t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c71f33ed-a6c3-50f4-af95-943149e25f59" :answer/id #uuid "c71f33ed-a6c3-50f4-af95-943149e25f59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\sin^{3}{t}+4\\cos{t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a9bff1c3-a55f-505a-b6af-8f936dcf6336" :answer/id #uuid "a9bff1c3-a55f-505a-b6af-8f936dcf6336" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sin^{3}{t}+4\\cos{t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f0f110f6-d11f-507e-ba9c-4ea58e00874b" :answer/i